# chromadb pre-auth code injection — affects only the ChromaDB HTTP *server*
# (/api/v2 collections endpoint with trust_remote_code). CaseCite uses the embedded
# PersistentClient exclusively (backend/app/services/vectordb.py) and never runs
# the Chroma server, so the vulnerable endpoint does not exist in this image.
